  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "7f67300b-2264-4c06-81eb-f2df38af6b45",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## QA/QC Compliance & Non-Conformance RAG Copilot\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow acts as a QA/QC compliance copilot that receives a chat question, validates it, and uses a RAG agent to retrieve relevant quality documents and produce a structured non-conformance assessment. It normalizes the AI result, decides whether manual review is needed, then routes automated NCR classifications into a decision log. Higher-risk outcomes trigger escalation emails, while uncertain cases are logged separately and sent for manual review.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the chat trigger so users can submit QA/QC compliance or non-conformance questions.\n- Add credentials for Google Gemini, GitHub, Google Sheets, and Gmail.\n- Configure the QA knowledge repository or document retrieval endpoint used by the agent tools.\n- Map the Google Sheets nodes to the QA decision log used for automated decisions and manual-review cases.\n- Set Gmail recipients, escalation criteria, and manual review alert recipients before activation.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the validation condition, structured output schema, severity thresholds, NCR classification routes, and escalation rules to match the organization’s QA/QC procedures."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "46345ca7-11bc-48c0-8efb-6fafe74652da",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        560,
        368
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Capture and validate query\n\nReceives the chat request, enriches it with request metadata, and checks whether it is a valid QA/QC query before invoking the RAG process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "440b910b-ad8d-4b40-8783-219bee358abc",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1360,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 704,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "## Run QA RAG agent\n\nUses Gemini with document retrieval, GitHub knowledge-file listing, and structured parsing tools to answer the QA/QC query and extract compliance-focused fields."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "30729b1b-3082-40ff-9cb6-e1e715312b0e",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2208,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 736,
        "height": 480,
        "content": "## Normalize and route outcome\n\nStandardizes the RAG output into fields such as classification, severity, violated requirement, and recommended action, then branches between manual review and automated NCR classification routing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "fe4aebfc-f20a-4cf8-ba8f-f9dce5d2bd95",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3120,
        416
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Log automated decision\n\nRecords classified QA decisions in Google Sheets and checks whether the logged decision meets escalation criteria."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "34525710-ea8c-4bb3-b315-453605bc667a",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3616,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Send escalation notice\n\nSends an escalation email for qualifying QA decisions and updates the sheet to show the escalation was sent."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3330ec6d-5f72-4b4d-8e25-69cfc43e017e",
